-/// `hears_step` from its parts: the hooks on (`hooks_on`) and the game Fates itself (`step_game`).
+/// `hears_step` from its parts: the hooks on (`hooks_on`) and a game with the step (`step_game`).
 pub fn listens(program_id: Option<u64>, fates_rando: bool, game: Option<&str>) -> bool {
     hooks_on(program_id, fates_rando) && step_game(game)
 }
 
 /// round 81b D1: the games whose randomizer hears the New Game step: Fates (`None`, the
-/// default, or "fates"); not a mod sharing the title id ("seal").
+/// default, or "fates"); round 82b S1: and Seal of Flames ("seal"), which has the randomizer
